    <briefdescription>
<para>Uniform random number generator. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Random number generator by Knuth. For more details see Knuth, Seminumerical Algorithms, 3rd edition, Section 3.6. <simplesect kind="note"><para>This is <bold>not</bold> Knuth&apos;s original implementation which is available at <ulink url="http://www-cs-faculty.stanford.edu/~knuth/programs.html,">http://www-cs-faculty.stanford.edu/~knuth/programs.html,</ulink> but rather a slightly modified version wrapped in a C++ class. Such modifications did not affect the code but only the data structures used, which were converted to their standard C++ equivalents. </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
